<title>BELGIUM: CYCLING-BOARDMAN WINS GP EDDY MERCKX TIME TRIAL.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-BOARDMAN WINS GP EDDY MERCKX TIME TRIAL.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the Grand Prix Eddy</p>
<p>Merckx individual time trial over 52 kms on Sunday:</p>
<p> 1. Chris Boardman (Britain)	1 hour 0 minutes 53 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Lance Armstrong (U.S.)	  1:37 behind</p>
<p> 3. Johan Museeuw (Belgium)	 1:49</p>
<p> 4. Jan Ullrich (Germany)	   3:10</p>
<p> 5. Viatcheslav Ekimov (Russia)   3:13</p>
<p> 6. Abraham Olano (Spain)	   3:15</p>
<p> 7. Rolf Aldag (Germany)	    3:20</p>
